Colors are custom properties, one per kind of name in a block,
so the highlighting of blocks can be changed in one place.
@<Project@/litar@/Web@/style rules@=
:root {
  --fg: #1f2328; --muted: #656d76; --line: #d0d7de; --bg: #ffffff; --panel: #f6f8fa;
  --accent: #0969da; --ref: #8250df; --item: #1a7f37; --header: #cf222e; --pipe: #953800;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body { margin: 0; font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; color: var(--fg); background: var(--bg);
  display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr; grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr; height: 100vh; }
header { grid-column: 1 / 3; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 8px 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); }
header h1 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 8px 0 0; }
header input, header select, header button { font: inherit; padding: 3px 6px; }
header .grow { flex: 1; min-width: 120px; }
@

The class wide hides the list, for the views that need no tree.
@<Project@/litar@/Web@/style rules@+
#sidebar { overflow: auto; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 8px; }
#main { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr; overflow: hidden; }
#tabs, .subtabs { display: flex; gap: 2px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0 8px; }
#tabs a, .subtabs a { padding: 6px 12px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; }
#tabs a.on, .subtabs a.on { color: var(--fg); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); }
#body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr; overflow: hidden; }
#list { overflow: auto; border-right: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 8px; }
#detail { overflow: auto; padding: 12px 16px; }
#body.wide { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
#body.wide #list { display: none; }
@

@<Project@/litar@/Web@/style rules@+
ul.tree { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding-left: 14px; }
ul.tree.top { padding-left: 0; }
ul.tree li { margin: 1px 0; }
.desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; margin-left: 6px; }
a { color: var(--accent); }
a.sel { font-weight: 600; }
.mod { font-weight: 600; }
ul.tree li.leaf { padding-left: 14px; }
summary { cursor: pointer; }
.filter { width: 100%; margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 3px 6px; font: inherit; }
.tools { display: flex; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.tools .filter { flex: 1; width: auto; margin: 0; }
.tools button { font: inherit; padding: 0 6px; }
h2 { font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 8px; word-break: break-all; }
